flowchart TD
    accTitle: M5 model routing sequence
    accDescr: Optional configured routing resolves model and effort, admits applicable budget, claims one action, and reconciles its receipt. Only policy-authorized alternatives may be selected; unsupported routes or blocked admission stop before work.
    A["1 · Request<br/>Work arrives"] --> B["2 · Resolve<br/>Role → tier ladder"]
    B --> C{3 · Select<br/>Tier eligible?}
    C -->|yes| D["4 · Route<br/>Model + effort + transport"]
    C -->|authorized alternative| E["Disclose allowed alternative"]
    E --> D
    D --> F["5 · Admit<br/>Forecast vs meters"]
    F -->|blocked| G["HOLD<br/>Blocked before carrier work"]
    F -->|admitted| H["6 · Claim<br/>One-way dispatch"]
    H --> I["7 · Carrier<br/>Work executes"]
    I --> J["8 · Reconcile<br/>Imported receipt only"]
    J --> K["9 · Receipt<br/>Route + tier + outcome"]
